+package server
+
+// Full native checkout integration: actual HTTP single-shot request -> real
+// core orchestrator -> real PM signature validation -> real SQLite receipt ->
+// existing ticket queue -> proxy receipt readback.
+//
+// Buyer key is an ephemeral generated test key with no wallet, funds, or
+// endpoint. Chain state, sender funds, gas, and time are synthetic; ticket
+// signatures, recipient validation, receipt storage, queueing, and proxy
+// provenance are all real implementations. Proof limits: no on-chain
+// redemption, no real funds, no cross-process restart; this suite runs on the
+// prepared Linux runner, not in this environment.
+
+import (
